@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Buying Help";
}

<div class="cs-content-page">
    <h1>BUYING HELP</h1>

    <div class="cs-faq-item">
        <h6>What payment methods are available?</h6>
        <p>We accept the various forms of EFT and cash upon delivery.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-faq-item">
        <h6>Can I cancel my order?</h6>
        <p>Yes, but only before they are processed. If not, please contact support as soon as possible and have your order details ready on hand.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-faq-item">
        <h6>How long will it take to get my item?</h6>
        <p>Highly dependent on where you stay but we do strive to have your item delivered to you as soon as possible.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-faq-item">
        <h6>Are all items available immediately?</h6>
        <p>Yes, all listed items are avaible for purchase. Once they are sold, their listing is removed to make sure our catalog is up to date.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-faq-item">
        <h6>Can someone else receive my order?</h6>
        <p>Yes, just as long as a notice is given ahead of time for either our driver or the chosen courier service to be informed..</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cs-faq-item">
        <h6>Are there additional charges at checkout?</h6>
        <p>There are no hidden fees. All the necessary fees will be clearly outlined at checkout before you proceed to finalize your order.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-4">
        <a asp-controller="Support" asp-action="Index" class="cs-btn">Back to Support Hub</a>
    </div>
</div>
